cff-version: 1.2.0
title: EXPRESSsuite
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this fork and the
  NIST-developed original it is based on.  See NOTICE.md for the
  modification history required by the NIST Software Licensing
  Statement.
type: software
version: "0.4.0"
date-released: "2026-05-02"
authors:
