    family-names: Thurman
    affiliation: TRThurman Consulting
    email: thomas@trthurman.consulting
license: MIT
license-url: https://github.com/TRThurman/EXPRESSsuite/blob/main/LICENSE
repository-code: https://github.com/TRThurman/EXPRESSsuite
url: https://github.com/TRThurman/EXPRESSsuite
abstract: >-
  A Visual Studio Code extension that provides language support and
  rich-content viewers (annotated AsciiDoc descriptions, EXPRESS-G
  diagram navigation, AsciiMath/LaTeX math rendering) for the
  EXPRESS (ISO 10303-11) information modeling language. EXPRESSsuite is
  derived from and substantially extends the NIST-developed easyEXPRESS.
keywords:
  - EXPRESS
  - "ISO 10303-11"
  - STEP
  - "Visual Studio Code"
  - language-server
  - annotated-EXPRESS
  - Metanorma
  - Plurimath
